# Local vendored JUCE checkout. CMake now fetches JUCE itself via FetchContent
# (pinned to commit b272f968aa, tag 8.0.8-146-gb272f968aa); this copy is only kept
# on disk for other local tooling and must never be tracked.
JUCE/

# CMake build trees — regenerated by Build_Create.command
ChordFoundry/build*/
_deps/

# Version control / tooling internals
.diversion/
.remember/
.claude/

# Build artifacts
*.o
*.obj
*.a
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib
*.app

# Python bytecode (archive/ holds the original Python version)
__pycache__/
*.pyc

.DS_Store
*~
*.swp

# Owner's Python prototype and internal working notes — not part of the public repo
archive/
COMPREHENSIVE_ASSESSMENT_REPORT.md
PYTHON_TO_JUCE_MAPPING.md
JUCE_SETUP_GUIDE.md
UI_MODERNIZATION_DOCUMENTATION.md
CLAUDE.md
STATUS.md
